OL,3,GNEWSACrown Works funding queries 'will
OL,4,Anot cause delays'
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueries about whether a local council
OL,7,Fshould pay for a multimillion-pound
OL,8,Ffilm studio will not delay the project,
OL,9,Faccording to the mayoral authority.
OL,11,FSunderland's Crown Works Studios
OL,12,Fdevelopment is to be built in an
OL,13,Fattempt to boost the region's film
OL,14,Findustry while regenerating the city's
OL,15,FPallion and Ford ward.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1795080358
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACrown Works funding queries 'will
OL,4,Anot cause delays'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Competition and Markets
OL,7,FAuthority's Subsidy Advice Unit (SAU)
OL,8,Fhas asked the North East Mayoral
OL,9,FStrategic Authority (NEMSA) to provide
OL,10,Ffurther clarification on why it is
OL,11,Ffunding the #38m project, rather than
OL,12,FSunderland City Council.
OL,14,FNEMSA said it would now work to address
OL,15,Fthe questions, but the SAU's queries
OL,16,Fwould not delay the studios'
OL,17,Fconstruction.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
